# A singly-placed, non-wrapper child whose own action structurally repaints itself

## Component Counter

State:
    Let c be 0.
Actions:
    To inc:
        Set c to c + 1.
View:
    <div class="counter"><span id="c">{c}</span>{if c > 1:}<b>big</b>{end}<button id="inc" on-click={inc}>+</button></div>

## Page /

State:
    Let on be false.
Actions:
    To flip:
        Set on to not on.
View:
    <main>
      <Counter/>
      {if on:}<p id="flag">on</p>{end}
      <button id="flip" on-click={flip}>flip</button>
    </main>

## Test: a child's own structural repaint leaves its siblings in place
    Click "#inc".
    Click "#inc".
    Expect that the text of "#c" is equal to "2".
    Expect that "#flip" is visible.
